{
    "title": "Booksy for Customers",
    "description": "Booksy makes it easy to book your self-care appointments anytime, anywhere so that you can get on with your day. Browse our marketplace to find your favorite providers, compare pricing, read reviews, and make your next booking.\r\n\r\nDiscover: Not sure where to start? Use our search tool to find your favorite provider or service.\r\n\r\nBook 24/7: Check for available appointments without having to pick up the phone. Simply find a time that works for you and get on the books.\r\n\r\nMake Changes On-the-Fly: Cancel, reschedule, or rebook appointments easily - all from your Booksy app.\r\n\r\nGet Notified: You\u2019re busy, we get it. We\u2019ll send reminders so you never miss an appointment.\r\n\r\nContactless Payments: Ditch cash or cards! Pay directly through Booksy if your provider uses Mobile Payments.\r\n\r\nScheduling appointments shouldn\u2019t feel like a chore. Booksy makes it easy to book all of the services you love, from the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\nFor business owners looking to streamline the day-to-day, check out Booksy Biz, our app for providers. You can also give us a shout to learn more: info.us@booksy.com.",
